{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i", "title": "離婁上", "description": "孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方", "occurrences": 30, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "今", "id": "今"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "在", "id": "在"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "安", "id": "安"}, {"form": "居", "id": "居"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "水", "id": "水"}, {"form": "治", "id": "治"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "諸侯", "id": "諸侯"}, {"form": "高", "id": "高"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.1948403207626634, "source": "下", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 4.28588277412098, "source": "下", "target": "水"}, {"weight": 1.7338368214953503, "source": "今", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.052290552613885, "source": "今", "target": "惡"}, {"weight": 2.339972625065666, "source": "今", "target": "樂"}, {"weight": 1.2791006643804035, "source": "今", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 0.7995275841185171, "source": "今", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 0.9071582483108824, "source": "治", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.7401041636477164, "source": "治", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 1.800976124332979, "source": "治", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 1.1948403207626634, "source": "樂", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.899588413001089, "source": "樂", "target": "惡"}, {"weight": 1.0406896409354052, "source": "君", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.5482131558376111, "source": "君", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 0.827115540637346, "source": "天下", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.0277862360994972, "source": "天下", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 0.04695698308777108, "source": "天下", "target": "在"}, {"weight": 0.7893752126544991, "source": "仁", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 0.9071582483108824, "source": 